00:16:05.400 --> 00:16:12.780
And I see Bitcoin is a driving force to right those wrongs in the world by fixing the money supply.

265
00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:18.720
So if you go back to the original point I was making about the origin of money, that money is not a material thing.

266
00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:20.100
And it should not be.

267
00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:31.440
That is fixing a key part of civilization because trade and the ability for us to interact with one another through trade is the basis of civilization.

