286
00:17:37.260 --> 00:17:37.360
Right.

287
00:17:37.460 --> 00:17:47.820
But if money is information and Bitcoin is simply information and we embrace Bitcoin to be money, then we can fix that problem because now it is easy to move and easy to store.

