00:22:52.980 --> 00:23:02.380
And I think this is why money has largely lost its value as money because it's being used as a surveillance tool.

369
00:23:03.100 --> 00:23:07.740
Even in the U.S., if you send someone $600, you have to report that transaction.

370
00:23:08.660 --> 00:23:10.020
Denominations are getting more worthless.

