397
00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:04.440
And the president there understands that Bitcoin will go up because he is a Bitcoiner.

398
00:25:04.960 --> 00:25:07.620
And then your people will accumulate wealth.

399
00:25:07.840 --> 00:25:13.340
They'll be able to send their kids to better schools, create companies, businesses, and grow from there.

400
00:25:13.340 --> 00:25:19.020
But if you're just contracting, protecting what you have, you'll decline.

401
00:25:19.380 --> 00:25:23.400
And the good counter example to Al Salvador, I think, is Japan.

402
00:25:23.820 --> 00:25:32.900
You've had decades of stagnation and problems, ballooning debt to GDP ratio, 260-some-odd percent.

403
00:25:32.900 --> 00:25:35.120
That's completely unsustainable.

404
00:25:35.480 --> 00:25:38.740
There's population decline because there's no hope for the future.

405
00:25:39.080 --> 00:25:39.640
That is true.

406
00:25:39.680 --> 00:25:41.820
And it's too expensive to have children now.

407
00:25:42.160 --> 00:25:43.740
So what you get is a death spiral.

408
00:25:44.020 --> 00:25:47.440
You can't tax the population to generate prosperity.

409
00:25:47.940 --> 00:25:50.820
You need to create conditions for prosperity.

