So who is going to want to be there to, you know, use Bitcoin or anything else to generate money or build a business there?

414
00:26:08.520 --> 00:26:14.100
Unless you're attacking that market specifically and you have a regulatory moat.

415
00:26:14.620 --> 00:26:17.560
But if you're a free market company, why would you domicile in Japan?

416
00:26:18.020 --> 00:26:19.700
Why would you hire people there?

417
00:26:20.020 --> 00:26:20.700
You probably won't.

418
00:26:20.800 --> 00:26:21.360
You probably won't.

419
00:26:21.360 --> 00:26:23.480
You'll go somewhere else where it's more favorable.

420
00:26:24.140 --> 00:26:25.980
But then they want to tax everything.

421
00:26:26.500 --> 00:26:31.140
And eventually it'll just end because you can't get blood from a stone.

422
00:26:31.300 --> 00:26:32.300
You can keep squeezing it.

423
00:26:32.620 --> 00:26:34.220
But then the people will just suffer.

424
00:26:34.640 --> 00:26:38.500
When a government has Bitcoin, who's holding the private key?

425
00:26:39.300 --> 00:26:40.300
Well, that's an interesting one.

426
00:26:40.500 --> 00:26:45.080
So I think El Salvador now, they have a local storage system.

427
00:26:45.600 --> 00:26:47.280
I think it's multi-sig.

428
00:26:47.560 --> 00:26:47.800
Okay.

429
00:26:48.260 --> 00:26:50.600
But yeah, that could be a way.

430
00:26:50.600 --> 00:26:52.160
Or you could have regulated custodians.

431
00:26:52.600 --> 00:26:59.380
I mean, there is one thing the government should be good at, which should be keeping people's things safe, right?

432
00:26:59.380 --> 00:27:05.880
Both your property, enforcing property rights and creating rules where companies can't go rogue and do whatever they like.

433
00:27:05.880 --> 00:27:08.200
That's, I think, one value add from government.

434
00:27:08.200 --> 00:27:13.140
So there should be regulated custodians that cannot mess around and lose people's money.

435
00:27:13.360 --> 00:27:23.800
And theoretically, the government should be able to use those systems or an array of those systems and some systems out of country to do a multi-sig and protect their funds.

