447
00:27:53.580 --> 00:27:58.860
It's still getting to where it is going and it's on a good trajectory, but there's still work to be done.

448
00:27:59.680 --> 00:28:00.040
Right.

449
00:28:00.120 --> 00:28:03.900
So it just means you can, let's say if I want to buy a house, I can actually pay in Bitcoin.

